name xkeymask
category Package
revision 69223
shortdesc An extension of xkeyval with a mask
relocated 1
longdesc This package is an extension of the xkeyval package by Hendri
longdesc Adriaens that offers macros for hiding certain keys so that
longdesc they are not used in certain places. The idea is that one first
longdesc imports the package in the document preamble, and then creates
longdesc masks use at certain points in the document. The mask can also
longdesc be queried or cleared at some later point.
runfiles size=1
 RELOC/tex/latex/xkeymask/xkeymask.sty
